{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function getAllKeys(objectStore): Promise<IDBValidKey[]>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:364"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Retrieves all keys from an object store."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Uses the native "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getAllKeys()"},{"type":"text","value":" method for efficient bulk key retrieval."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"objectstore","children":[{"type":"text","value":"objectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBObjectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The IDBObjectStore to read keys from"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBValidKey"},{"type":"text","value":"[]>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A promise that resolves to an array of all keys in the store"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"await executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const allKeys = await getAllKeys(stores.todos)\n  console.log('All keys:', allKeys)\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"objectstore","text":"objectStore","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction getAllKeys(objectStore): Promise<IDBValidKey[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:364\n\nRetrieves all keys from an object store.\n\nUses the native `getAllKeys()` method for efficient bulk key retrieval.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to read keys from\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`IDBValidKey`[]\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of all keys in the store\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const allKeys = await getAllKeys(stores.todos)\n  console.log('All keys:', allKeys)\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: getAllKeys\ntitle: getAllKeys\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction getAllKeys(objectStore): Promise<IDBValidKey[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:364\n\nRetrieves all keys from an object store.\n\nUses the native `getAllKeys()` method for efficient bulk key retrieval.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to read keys from\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`IDBValidKey`[]\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of all keys in the store\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const allKeys = await getAllKeys(stores.todos)\n  console.log('All keys:', allKeys)\n})\n```\n"}
